 "headline": "An epic premiere it was! - ultimatemoviebuff",
 "intro": "IHC PRODUCED A THUNDEROUS PREMIERE AT THE CHINESE THEATER FOR GODZILLA MINUS ZERO, THE FIRST JAPANESE FILM SHOT IN IMAX.",
 "introPieces": [
  {
   "type": "introGallery",
   "html": "<p>Living up to the legends of cinema history, the latest iteration of Godzilla arrived in Hollywood with all the glitz and spectacle he deserved. For one night, the film cast and crew, industry elite, creators and super fans came together to celebrate the unveiling of this latest chapter.</p>\n<p>From a red carpet premiere to an exclusive after party, Godzilla Minus Zero showed up in style, embodying the tone and elevated take of the movie itself while being a content and press opportunity for the world to see.</p>",
   "media": []
  }
 ],
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "red carpet",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>Cast, filmmakers, celebrities, and influencers walked the red carpet and posed against the branded step-and-repeat. A dedicated press line hosted media outlets, including Deadline, Buzzfeed, CBS and Getty. The premiere welcomed director, Takashi Yamazaki, and cast members, Minami Hamabe and Ryunosuke Kamiki. A large-scale entrance banner featuring the film’s key art was positioned to welcome guests and provide a bold branded presence along the exterior. A dedicated fan pit welcomed fans for an up-close arrival experience.</p>"
    },
