  },
  {
   "title": "photo moments",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>The carpet provided multiple photo opportunities, including a Godzilla-branded F1 car with its own dedicated photographer. Guests also had the opportunity to capture cinematic, slow-motion videos with an IMAX-branded Glambot activation, creating shareable content to post across social media. All guests had the opportunity to pose with the striking Godzilla statue, positioned at the theater entrance.</p>"
