  {
   "title": "interior decor",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>Central lobby display cases were wrapped in key art on all sides to maintain a cohesive, branded environment. Three display cases along the wall in the theater showcased various iconic Bandai Namco toys and collectibles, giving guests a closer look at some of the the monster’s most memorable eras. Concession stands featured title treatment and key art graphics.</p>"
    },
