  {
   "title": "the screening",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>As guests took their seats, the theater featured an ambient pre-show experience with the screening card displayed, and the soundtrack playing throughout the auditorium. A Q&amp;A followed, hosted by Megan Cruz and featuring key members of the film’s cast and creative team including director Takashi Yamazaki and cast members Minami Hamabe and Ryunosuke Kamiki.</p>"
