  {
   "title": "the afterparty",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text2",
     "left": "<p>Following the premiere, an exclusive, intimate after-party at Living Room featured DJ Allie Teilz on the decks. Guests enjoyed an open bar featuring specialty cocktails and passed canapés showcasing Japanese-inspired flavors.</p>",
     "right": "<p>The after-party decor featured title treatment moments, as well as blue uplighting and accent lighting.. The Garden Lounge featured a custom branded display with illuminated Godzilla popcorn buckets.</p>"
    },
